{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816650-line","text":"「嘿！我在哪？为什么有这么多人在我的脑子里吵架？」在发出疑问的同时，一股深深的愤懑浮现在你的脑海，想要破坏，想要把一切都撕裂。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816651-line","text":"你现在是一缕意识，一缕完美学者的意识。耳畔博识学会的学者们争论不休，未来，混沌，进化，语言，你听到他们的呢喃，但毫无意义。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816652-line","text":"将学会历史上最优秀学者们提取成数据，凝聚成唯一的模型。最好的可能，他们估测，博识学会的第一位完美学者将会诞生。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816653-line","text":"为首的学士启动实验，于是，新的电流又在意识里泛起。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-4212889095462125147-choice","text":"触碰理性。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-10242747397491776765-effect","text":"有概率获得3星奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-7494033108763424589-choice","text":"触碰感性。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-9999213317184194401-effect","text":"有概率获得3星祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-9304494832187859416-choice","text":"向深处沉没。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-5794859902008103169-effect","text":"求知毫无意义。","speaker":""}]}
